From 2c8af4376e3e4430d170692aa881ddbf6093f6b8 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Langsdorff <131063968+clangsdorff@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Tue, 24 Nov 2026 23:15:58 +0300
Subject: [PATCH 3/3] securize: set the device props on early-fs

vendor tee daemons read the device name once when they start on fs,
which is before rw-system.sh runs on post-fs, so teei_daemon keeps the
gsi name and the microtrust tee rejects tas that check the android
model (fingerprint ta on the doogee v40). restarting teei_daemon is not
an option, a second one hangs in teei_config_ioctl. move the device
prop part of securize into phh-device-props.sh and run it on early-fs.
---
 base.mk                |  1 +
 phh-device-props.sh    | 80 ++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++
 rw-system.sh           | 74 --------------------------------------
 sepolicy/file_contexts |  1 +
 vndk.rc                |  3 ++
 5 files changed, 85 insertions(+), 74 deletions(-)
 create mode 100755 phh-device-props.sh

